// ─── Optional local overrides ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Untracked (see .gitignore) and absent by default, so a fresh clone builds with the values
// above. Create Rem/Release.local.xcconfig to point telemetry, OAuth or the API at your own
// accounts WITHOUT editing this tracked file — which is how a secret ends up in a commit.
//
// Placed at the END deliberately: xcconfig resolves duplicate assignments last-one-wins, so
// an include at the top would be silently overridden by the settings above and the override
// would appear to do nothing.
//
// `#include?` is the optional form — a no-op when the file does not exist.
#include? "Release.local.xcconfig"
